      "documentId": "doc-nhs-hydration",
      "sourceId": "src-nhs",
      "section": "Fluid intake",
      "content": "Most adults should drink enough fluid so that urine is pale yellow. Around 6 to 8 glasses of fluid per day is a common general guide, but needs vary with activity and climate."
    },
    {
